---
title: "parse_data_sources (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: assert len(chain_ids) == len(addresses)
    q_validate --> q_init: sources = empty vector, i = 0
    q_init --> q_check: i < len(chain_ids)
    q_check --> q_build: true
    q_check --> [*]: false, return sources
    q_build --> q_push: data_source::new(chain_ids[i], ext_addr(addresses[i]))
    q_push --> q_inc: push_back(sources, source), i = i + 1
    q_inc --> q_check

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: aborts with E_DATA_SOURCE_EMITTER_ADDRESS_AND_CHAIN_IDS_DIFFERENT_LENGTHS if lengths differ
        INV-002: each DataSource has a unique (chain_id, address) pair
    end note
